  "hook": "Your funnel says half the users drop at checkout, and the numbers are wrong.",
  "question": "Design funnel and attribution events for a mobile app.",
  "trap": "The trap: count raw events per screen. Retries double count, offline events arrive late, and the install source is lost.",
  "steps": [
   "One event per step. Give each step a stable name, fired once per attempt.",
   "Carry the context. Every event holds the user id and session id, so steps join without guessing.",
   "Attribution at install. Read the install referrer once, store source and campaign, and attach them later.",
   "Dedupe on the server. An event id drops retries, and client time fixes the order."
  ],
  "takeaway": "One event per step, one id per journey, attribution saved at install.",
  "teaser": "Tomorrow: experiment exposure logging.",
  "cta": "Comment M S D for the free cheatsheet."
